Z||000014||Tigger||03-07-2001||12:11 AM||||In the very upper right hand corner of this page, click on the profile link. Enter your screenname password.<BR>There's a section for the signature. Use the PIP along with UBB code to make the picture you uploaded show up. Read the link to use the UBB code<P>Here's the code for the image of your car.<P>[img ]http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Cuz2.jpg[/img]<P>Except no space in [img]<P>When you post a message, click the show signature box and it will add the sig to the end of your post.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 03-07-2001).]||||reg||1
